# Root cause: the menu still runs a TAAU pass for its background, and injection outside
# the world is a no-op (recordInternal returns true without recording), so
# gLastInjectionOk stayed true and the draw-level suppress kept skipping that pass -
# the menu kept showing the last world frame. The gate had no world check.
# Fix under test in EXP-0069: require worldLoaded() and arg10SolidArmed() before the
# quad is skipped.
